*> PURPOSE : PAYROLL DEDUCTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 660
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0015.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PAY0015C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WS-BEN             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    05 PR-RT              PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 4000-BENEFITS
    PERFORM SET-PENSION
    DISPLAY "WS-BEN=" WS-BEN
    DISPLAY "PR-RT=" PR-RT
    STOP RUN.
4000-BENEFITS.
    *> BENEFITS ELIGIBILITY
    IF WS-ETYP = 'F'
       OR (WS-ETYP EQUAL TO 'P' AND WS-HRS >= 20)
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-BEN
    END-IF.
SET-PENSION.
    IF WS-PENIN = 'Y'
       AND T-YR >= 3
        MOVE 0.0600 TO PR-RT
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0200 TO PR-RT
    END-IF.
